# dCMS.Catalog.Api — manual smoke / REST Client (VS / Rider / VS Code REST Client)
# Default URL matches Properties/launchSettings.json ("http" profile) and infra/docker-compose catalog-api port mapping.
# When Dcms auth is enabled, set @token to a JWT with catalog:read / catalog:write for @tenantId + @storeId.

@dCMS.Catalog.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5001
@tenantId = t1
@storeId = s1
@productId = prod_REPLACE_ME
@variantId = var_REPLACE_ME
@token =

### Health (anonymous)

GET {{dCMS.Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Public storefront — slug check (rate limited)

GET {{dCMS.Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/products/slug-check?tenantId={{tenantId}}&storeId={{storeId}}&slug=my-product-slug
Accept: application/json

###

### Public storefront — search

GET {{dCMS.Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/products?tenantId={{tenantId}}&storeId={{storeId}}&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

###

### Public storefront — product by slug

GET {{dCMS.Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/products/my-product-slug?tenantId={{tenantId}}&storeId={{storeId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Store-scoped — categories (catalog:read when auth on)

GET {{dCMS.Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/{{tenantId}}/stores/{{storeId}}/categories
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Store-scoped — variant axes (wizard Step 3)

GET {{dCMS.Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/{{tenantId}}/stores/{{storeId}}/variant-axes
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Store-scoped — product search (Elasticsearch)

GET {{dCMS.Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/{{tenantId}}/stores/{{storeId}}/products?pageSize=10&sort=priceasc
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Store-scoped — pending approvals (DAI-658; catalog:approval when auth on)

GET {{dCMS.Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/{{tenantId}}/stores/{{storeId}}/products/pending-approvals?limit=50
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Store-scoped — get product

GET {{dCMS.Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/{{tenantId}}/stores/{{storeId}}/products/{{productId}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Store-scoped — list variants

GET {{dCMS.Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/{{tenantId}}/stores/{{storeId}}/products/{{productId}}/variants
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Store-scoped — create product (catalog:write; Idempotency-Key recommended)

POST {{dCMS.Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/{{tenantId}}/stores/{{storeId}}/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "categoryId": 1,
  "nameJson": "{\"vi\":\"Tên sản phẩm\",\"en\":\"Product name\"}",
  "descriptionJson": "{\"vi\":\"Mô tả\",\"en\":\"Description\"}",
  "slug": "my-product-slug"
}

###

### Store-scoped — update product (full replace)

PUT {{dCMS.Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/{{tenantId}}/stores/{{storeId}}/products/{{productId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "categoryId": 1,
  "nameJson": "{\"vi\":\"Tên sản phẩm\",\"en\":\"Product name\"}",
  "descriptionJson": "{\"vi\":\"Mô tả\",\"en\":\"Description\"}",
  "slug": "my-product-slug"
}

###

### Store-scoped — bulk create (≤100 items)

POST {{dCMS.Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/{{tenantId}}/stores/{{storeId}}/products/bulk
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "items": [
    {
      "categoryId": 1,
      "nameJson": "{\"vi\":\"Bulk A\"}",
      "descriptionJson": "{}",
      "slug": "bulk-product-a"
    }
  ]
}

###

### Store-scoped — bulk update (≤100 items)

PUT {{dCMS.Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/{{tenantId}}/stores/{{storeId}}/products/bulk
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "{{productId}}",
      "categoryId": 1,
      "nameJson": "{\"vi\":\"Bulk update name\"}",
      "descriptionJson": "{}",
      "slug": "bulk-updated-slug"
    }
  ]
}

###

### Store-scoped — generate variants

POST {{dCMS.Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/{{tenantId}}/stores/{{storeId}}/products/{{productId}}/variants/generate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "axes": [
    { "attributeId": 1, "valueIds": [10, 11] },
    { "attributeId": 2, "valueIds": [20] }
  ],
  "skuPrefix": "sku"
}

###

### Store-scoped — update variant (SKU / status / sortOrder)

PUT {{dCMS.Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/{{tenantId}}/stores/{{storeId}}/products/{{productId}}/variants/{{variantId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "sku": "sku-001",
  "status": "active",
  "sortOrder": 0
}

###

### Store-scoped — submit for approval

POST {{dCMS.Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/{{tenantId}}/stores/{{storeId}}/products/{{productId}}/submit-for-approval
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{}

###

### Store-scoped — publish

POST {{dCMS.Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/{{tenantId}}/stores/{{storeId}}/products/{{productId}}/publish
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{}

###

### Store-scoped — hide (active → hidden)

POST {{dCMS.Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/{{tenantId}}/stores/{{storeId}}/products/{{productId}}/hide
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{}

###

### Store-scoped — unhide (hidden → active)

POST {{dCMS.Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/{{tenantId}}/stores/{{storeId}}/products/{{productId}}/unhide
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{}

###

### Store-scoped — archive (soft delete)

POST {{dCMS.Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/{{tenantId}}/stores/{{storeId}}/products/{{productId}}/archive
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{}

###

### Store-scoped — delete (maps to archive)

DELETE {{dCMS.Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/{{tenantId}}/stores/{{storeId}}/products/{{productId}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

###
